'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a bug-themed [[deity]] that is a light god of Rebirth and Sunrise. He is currently a retainer for [[Adrasteia]], formerly a retainer for [[Khnum]]. [[Carl]], [[Katia Grim]], and [[Prepotente]] get marked for death by this god when they storm into his temple on the [[Ninth Floor]] to kill [[Vinata]] during [[Operation Snake Pit]].

[[Scavenger's Daughter Upgrade Patch|Scavenger's Daughter]] Effect: You are [[Immortality|immortal]] for the next 90 seconds.

==Description==
Khepri is described as humanoid, with two legs and arms (though more like a [[Forsoothed|Soother]] than human), but instead of a head, there is an entire bug. Not a bug head, but a whole 6 legged beetle, with wings and a tiny head of its own.{{cite|7|52}}

Khepri is described by the [[System AI]] as being "honor bound towards his guests, despite being pissed off and terrified."{{cite|7|53}}
